  are rotations and the stress tensor recovered?>|<cell|<hlink|VI.2|outline/units/VI-2.tm>,
  <hlink|VI.1|outline/units/VI-1.tm>, with
  <hlink|VII.1|outline/units/VII-1.tm> and
  <hlink|VII.6|outline/units/VII-6.tm> for the free
  comparison>>|<row|<cell|What makes the theory
  nonfree?>|<cell|<hlink|VII.2|outline/units/VII-2.tm>,
  <hlink|VII.3|outline/units/VII-3.tm>, with
  <hlink|VII.6|outline/units/VII-6.tm> for arbitrary short-distance
